<title>POLAND: BIG up in Warsaw continuous trade.</title>
<headline>BIG up in Warsaw continuous trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>1045 GMT -  Shares in BIG were quoted at 3.4 zlotys in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday, three percent higher than at Monday's main market fixing,</p>
<p>The other four stocks in the continuous system -- BPH, Debica, Elektrim and Rolimpex -- did not yet trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were at 95.5 zlotys, 1.6 percent higher than at Monday's regular bourse session.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
